{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"carcass_deer","model_identifier":"carcass_deer","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# carcass_deer\n\nDeer carcass\n\n- Baked from `deer.bbmodel`: the final (held) frame of its `death` clip, frozen into the groups' rest rotations so it needs no animation.\n- Same texture and UV layout as the source animal (its variant textures also fit).\n- Hit box / interaction: workers butcher it from the side; use the lying body's footprint (see bounds in Blockbench).\n- When butchered out, replace with `carcass_bones`.\n"},"description":"# carcass_deer\n\nDeer carcass\n\n- Baked from `deer.bbmodel`: the final (held) frame of its `death` clip, frozen into the groups' rest rotations so it needs no animation.\n- Same texture and UV layout as the source animal (its variant textures also fit).\n- Hit box / interaction: workers butcher it from the side; use the lying body's footprint (see bounds in Blockbench).\n- When butchered out, replace with `carcass_bones`.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"barrel","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.0,36.546,-15.0],"to":[5.0,48.546,12.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,44.546,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[27,41,37.0,53.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[100,27,127.0,39.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[37,41,47.0,53.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,41,27.0,53.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,10.0,27.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[10,0,20.0,27.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"69ddd57b-66ec-5e58-b00a-86cbe33f50cf"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,34.546,-19.0],"to":[4.5,47.546,-14.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.